La cosa `sensor01` tiene asociado a su certificado esta política del tema 4. ¿Qué puede hacer?
```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["iot:Publish"],
      "Resource": ["arn:aws:iot:us-east-1:123456789012:topic/${iot:Connection.Thing.ThingName}"]
    },
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["iot:Connect"],
      "Resource": ["arn:aws:iot:us-east-1:123456789012:client/${iot:Connection.Thing.ThingName}"]
    }
  ]
}
```
